LCAO multi-k neutral water with SCCS (imp_sol 2) in a weak custom dielectric
(sccs_epsilon 1.1) and 2D PCC (assume_isolated pcc_2d, pcc_2d_axis 1: open along y). The 2x1x2 mesh keeps
Gamma along the open direction, as pcc_2d requires, and kpar 2 covers k-point pools.
Checks the total energy, forces, E_sol_el, E_sol_cav and E_pcc against an ABACUS baseline.
